    thin_dim: always 2 (perpendicular to blue edge)
    thick_dim: even in {2,4,6,8} (along blue edge)
    placement: |
      Two bands parallel to blue edge at db=1 and db=4 from the blue line.
      Within each band, rects separated by 2 bg cells along the blue direction.
      First rect starts at dr=1 from the red line.
    color: dominant color from {3,4,5,6,7,9}; repeats allowed across rects
    multicolor: 0-3 rects may have 2-3 minority pixels of 1-2 other colors (<=25% of area) [observed]
